      "decided_by": "omn-tech-lead subagent a02e34fe4fab1c375, recorded by session operator for vuhoangcao",
      "rationale": "The triage reproduces DF-001 deterministically with a --no-replay control and traces it to two source-confirmed causes: M14 replays the runtime in place against committed run evidence while its fingerprint omits the bookkeeping the replay rewrites, and the checklist runner executes items at the repository root judged by exit code only. Conditions: close Q-001 before finalising; isolate M14 in a disposable copy holding runtime, registry and run, removed in a finally block; copy the working tree as it is for checklist items; fail the checklist on any git status difference; add regression tests; leave committed evidence and runtime replay design untouched.",
      "evidence_ref": "runs/run-2cf7a34e3daa/states/triage-and-impact",
      "decided_at": "2026-10-18T11:43:16Z",
      "decision_history": []
    },
