      "owner_role": "dev-2-reviewer",
      "decided_by": "omn-dev-2-reviewer subagent ad05a67feccdff38f, recorded by session operator for vuhoangcao",
      "rationale": "M14 now replays in a disposable copy that it also fingerprints, and every checklist command item runs in its own copy, with S11 comparing file content before and after, so no verifier path writes committed run evidence. A re-run confirmed 5 of 5 isolation tests and M14 15 of 15 with the working tree byte-identical. Non-blocking findings: no test proves S11 fails when something writes (F-001), the multi-minute checklist test enters the default CI test run unchecked on POSIX (F-002), content comparison misses mode-only changes (F-003), and recovery cleanup errors can mask a scenario exception (F-004).",
      "evidence_ref": "runs/run-2cf7a34e3daa/states/fix-implementation",
      "decided_at": "2026-10-19T03:41:03Z",
      "decision_history": []
    },
