      "rationale": "The regression validation meets all three Expected behaviour criteria with checks it ran itself: the checklist and every verifier left the tree unchanged, M14 still replays and still catches real side effects, and the new clean-tree test asserts both git status and file content. A spot-check confirmed 5 of 5 isolation tests and M14 15 of 15 with git status and every listed file digest unchanged. No defect is open; F-001 to F-004 and the CI duration are carried to closure as owned open items.",
