      "rationale": "The closure record shows all three fix-bug exit criteria met: qa validated AC-001 to AC-003 with verdict pass and no open defect, the root cause is documented in the validated root-cause analysis, and regression tests cover the failure path, with every earlier gate decided by an owner that did not produce its evidence. The ten follow-ups are owned and carried forward as the known issue status. The runtime README and release checklist text match the delivered verifier code, with minor wording corrections to the README to apply.",
